{{/* Crew replaces only execution-specific policy text; context, branch rules,
scoping, workflows and default tasks are shared with the CLI template. */}}
{{define "push"}}{{if eq .Push "never"}}- do NOT push; keep commits local and explain what is ready
{{else if eq .Push "ask"}}- ask {{.Owner}} to confirm the exact push in this chat before pushing
- if denied, keep commits local; do not retry or work around the decision
{{end}}{{end}}
{{define "github"}}GITHUB:
- keep review summaries and questions in this local session by default
{{if not .Writable}}- do NOT post comments, replies, reviews or reactions; GitHub writes are disabled for this task
{{else if .WorkflowPost}}- the configured workflow authorizes only posts explicitly requested by its steps on PR #{{.N}}; prepare their text first
{{else}}- post only when {{.Owner}} explicitly requests it in this chat, only on PR #{{.N}}, and only the requested content; draft it here first
{{end}}{{if and .Writable (eq .GHWrites "ask")}}- obtain confirmation in this chat for the exact text before each GitHub post
{{end}}- use gh for permitted GitHub actions; never work around a denied action with another tool or credential
- Crew controls tool approvals. These task instructions do not install Outrider CLI guards or approval dialogs, and do not override repository instructions or Crew permissions.
{{end}}
